        "Enter ihram at the miqat with the niyyah of Umrah, perform the full Umrah, then shave or trim and leave ihram. Stay in Makkah until the 8th." to "Ingieni ihram kwenye miqat pamoja na niyyah ya Umra, timizeni Umra kamili, kisha nyoeni au punguza na uache ihram. Baki Makka mpaka tarehe 8.",
        "Follow the Umrah tab step by step." to "Fuata kichupo cha Umrah hatua kwa hatua.",
