        "Perform the Tawaf and Sa'i of Umrah but do not shave. Then perform Tawaf al-Qudum; you may do the Sa'i of Hajj after it." to "Tekeleza Tawaf na Sa'i ya Umra lakini usinyoe. Kisha fanya Tawaf al-Qudum; mnaweza kufanya Sa'i ya Hajj baada yake.",
