        "The arrival Tawaf, Sunnah for pilgrims from outside the miqat. You may do the Sa'i of Hajj after it." to "Kufika Tawaf, Sunnah kwa mahujaji kutoka nje ya miqat. Unaweza kufanya Sa'i ya Hajj baada yake.",
        "If you will do Sa'i after it, men do Raml and Idtiba in this Tawaf." to "Ikiwa utafanya Sa'i baada yake, wanaume hufanya Raml na Idtiba katika Tawaf hii.",
        "Put on ihram in Makkah with the niyyah of Hajj, recite the Talbiyah and go to Mina. Pray Dhuhr to the next Fajr there." to "Vaeni ihram huko Makka pamoja na niyyah ya Hajj, someni Talbiyah na nendeni Mina. Sali Dhuhr hadi Alfajiri inayofuata hapo.",
        "Stay in your ihram and go to Mina with the Talbiyah. Pray Dhuhr to the next Fajr there." to "Kaa katika ihram yako na uende Mina pamoja na Talbiyah. Sali Dhuhr hadi Alfajiri inayofuata hapo.",
        "Staying in Mina on the 8th and the night of the 9th is Sunnah." to "Kukaa Mina siku ya 8 na usiku wa tarehe 9 ni Sunnah.",
        "Recite the Talbiyah often." to "Soma Talbiyah mara kwa mara.",
        "Being in Arafat for any moment from zawal on the 9th until dawn of the 10th fulfils the fard; staying until sunset is wajib." to "Kuwa katika Arafa kwa muda wowote kuanzia zawal tarehe 9 mpaka alfajiri ya tarehe 10 kunatimiza fard; kukaa mpaka kuzama kwa jua ni wajibu.",
        "Hanafi: Dhuhr and Asr are combined only behind the Imam of Hajj at Masjid Namirah. In your tent, pray each at its own time." to "Hanafi: Dhuhr na Asr zimeunganishwa tu nyuma ya Imamu wa Hajj katika Masjid Namirah. Katika hema lenu, salini kila mmoja kwa wakati wake.",
        "Stay inside the boundary markers of Arafat." to "Kaa ndani ya alama za mpaka wa Arafat.",
        "Spend the afternoon standing in dua, istighfar and Talbiyah, facing the Qibla." to "Tumia alasiri kwa kusimama katika dua, istighfar na Talbiyah, ukielekea Qibla.",
        "Leaving Arafat before sunset makes a Dam due, unless you return before sunset." to "Kuondoka Arafat kabla ya jua kuzama huleta Bwawa, isipokuwa ukirudi kabla ya jua kuzama.",
        "Leave Arafat after sunset without praying Maghrib. At Muzdalifah pray Maghrib and Isha together in Isha time and spend the night there." to "Ondoka Arafa baada ya kuzama kwa jua bila kuswali Maghrib. Huko Muzdalifah salini Maghrib na Isha pamoja katika wakati wa Isha na mlale humo usiku.",
        "The wajib wuquf is between dawn and sunrise on the 10th: pray Fajr early and stay in dhikr." to "Wajib wuquufu ni baina ya alfajiri na kuchomoza jua siku ya 10: sali Fajr mapema na kaa katika dhikr.",
        "Pick up chickpea-sized pebbles: 49 in all, or 70 if you will stay for the 13th." to "Chukua kokoto zenye ukubwa wa kunde: 49 kwa jumla, au 70 ikiwa utakaa kwa tarehe 13.",
        "The sick, elderly and weak may leave after midnight because of the crowd, with no penalty." to "Wagonjwa, wazee na dhaifu wanaweza kuondoka baada ya usiku wa manane kwa sababu ya umati, bila adhabu.",
        "Stone only Jamrat al-Aqabah (the big one) with seven pebbles, one at a time. Stop the Talbiyah with the first pebble." to "Jiwe tu Jamrat al-Aqabah (ile kubwa) yenye kokoto saba, moja baada ya nyingine. Simamisha Talbiyah na kokoto ya kwanza.",
        "Then offer the Qurbani (Dam-e-Shukr), then shave or trim. Hanafi: this order is wajib; breaking it makes a Dam due." to "Kisha toa Qurbani (Dam-e-Shukr), kisha unyoe au kata. Hanafi: amri hii ni wajib; kuvunja hufanya Bwawa kutokana.",
        "Then shave or trim. Qurbani is recommended for Ifrad; if you offer it, do so before Halq." to "Kisha kunyoa au kukata. Qurbani inapendekezwa kwa Ifrad; ukiitoa, fanya hivyo kabla ya Halq.",
        "The Sunnah time for this Rami is from sunrise until zawal." to "Wakati wa Sunnah kwa Rami hii ni kuanzia mawio ya jua mpaka zawal.",
        "After Halq everything forbidden in ihram becomes lawful except marital relations, until Tawaf al-Ziyarah." to "Baada ya Halq kila kitu kilichoharamishwa katika ihram kinakuwa halali isipokuwa mahusiano ya ndoa, mpaka Tawaf al-Ziyarah.",
        "The obligatory Tawaf of Hajj. Perform it after Halq, best on the 10th, and before sunset on the 12th." to "Tawaf ya faradhi ya Hajj. Ifanye baada ya Halq, bora zaidi tarehe 10, na kabla ya machweo ya 12.",
        "Then perform the Sa'i of Hajj between Safa and Marwah." to "Kisha fanya Sa'i ya Hajj baina ya Safa na Marwah.",
        "Perform the Sa'i of Hajj now if you did not do it after Tawaf al-Qudum." to "Tekeleza Sa'i ya Hija sasa ikiwa hukuifanya baada ya Tawaf al-Qudum.",
        "Delaying it past the 12th without excuse makes a Dam due. A woman in her period waits until she is pure, with no penalty." to "Kuchelewesha hadi tarehe 12 bila kisingizio hufanya Bwawa kulipwa. Mwanamke katika hedhi yake hungoja mpaka awe msafi, bila adhabu.",
        "After this Tawaf, marital relations also become lawful." to "Baada ya Tawaf hii, mahusiano ya ndoa pia yanakuwa halali.",
        "Spend the days in Mina. Each day after zawal stone all three — Ula, Wusta, then Aqabah — with seven pebbles each." to "Tumia siku huko Mina. Kila siku baada ya zawal kupiga mawe yote matatu - Ula, Wusta, kisha Aqabah - na kokoto saba kila moja.",
        "After the Ula and the Wusta, step aside, face the Qibla and make a long dua. Do not stop for dua after the Aqabah." to "Baada ya Ula na Wusta, kando, elekea Qibla na ufanye dua ndefu. Usisimame kwa ajili ya dua baada ya Aqabah.",
        "You may leave Mina on the 12th before sunset. If you are still in Mina at dawn on the 13th, the Rami of the 13th becomes wajib." to "Unaweza kuondoka Mina tarehe 12 kabla ya jua kutua. Ikiwa bado uko Mina alfajiri ya tarehe 13, Rami ya tarehe 13 inakuwa wajib.",
        "The sick and the weak who cannot reach the Jamarat may appoint someone to stone for them." to "Wagonjwa na wanyonge ambao hawawezi kufikia Jamarat wanaweza kuteua mtu wa kuwapiga mawe.",
        "Reset the counter each day." to "Weka upya kaunta kila siku.",
        "Tawaf al-Wida, wajib for pilgrims from outside the miqat. Make it your last act in Makkah." to "Tawaf al-Wida, wajib kwa mahujaji kutoka nje ya miqat. Fanya kuwa kitendo chako cha mwisho huko Makka.",
        "No Raml, Idtiba or Sa'i in this Tawaf." to "Hakuna Raml, Idtiba au Sa'i katika Tawaf hii.",
