        "Hajj wajib: Muzdalifah, Sa'i, Rami, Qurbani for Qiran and Tamattu', Halq or Qasr, Tawaf al-Wida." to "Hajj wajib: Muzdalifah, Sa'i, Rami, Qurbani kwa Qiran na Tamattu', Halq au Qasr, Tawaf al-Wida.",
        "Umrah: Ihram is the condition and Tawaf is fard; Sa'i and Halq or Qasr are wajib." to "Umrah: Ihram ni sharti na Tawaf ni fardhi; Sa'i na Halq au Qasr ni wajib.",
        "Missing a wajib without a valid excuse makes a Dam due: one goat or sheep slaughtered within the Haram." to "Kukosa wajib bila ya udhuru halali hulipa Bwawa: mbuzi au kondoo mmoja aliyechinjwa ndani ya Haram.",
